WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.570
In a world… where screenshots explain nothing…

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.343
one app dares to point.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:15.900
Meet Snapper. Named after a fish with an eye for detail.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:18.693
One shortcut. Drag. Snap.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.720
Box the number.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.280
Point at the peak.

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:24.717
Hide what's private.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:26.953
And zoom in on what matters.

00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:28.443
Frame it.

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:31.503
Click. Link copied.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:37.027
Paste it anywhere. And watch the questions stop.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:40.490
Need motion? Record. Trim. Send.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.930
Snapper. Screenshots that make the point.
